graph TD
    subgraph Physical Layer (IoT Edge)
        ESP[ESP8266 / Arduino]
        Sensors[Sensors: DHT11, Moisture, Ultrasonic, LDR]
        Actuators[Actuators: Water Pump, Servo Ramp, RGB LED]
        Sensors --> ESP
        ESP --> Actuators
    end

    subgraph Cloud Backend (Node.js/Express)
        API[REST API Gateway]
        WS[Socket.io WebSocket Server]
        Cron[Node-Cron Scheduler]
        
        API --> Auth[Auth & RBAC Middleware]
        Auth --> Controllers[Business Controllers]
        Cron --> Controllers
    end

    subgraph Persistence Layer
        DB[(MongoDB Atlas)]
    end

    subgraph Client Layer
        UI[React.js Frontend]
        Admin[Admin Dashboard]
    end

    ESP <-->|AT Commands / TCP HTTP| API
    Controllers <--> DB
    Controllers -->|Hardware Alerts & Ticket Sync| WS
    UI <-->|HTTPS REST| API
    Admin <-->|HTTPS REST| API
    WS <-->|WSS Real-Time| UI
    WS <-->|WSS Real-Time| Admin
